WEBVTT

00:04:58.662 --> 00:05:00.997
But you manage to get back
to your village,

00:05:01.031 --> 00:05:02.332
and the lion gives up,

00:05:02.332 --> 00:05:04.901
and you jump up and down and shout,

00:05:04.935 --> 00:05:07.337
and people come and listen
to you tell the story,

00:05:07.370 --> 00:05:08.505
and you hug each other,

00:05:08.538 --> 00:05:10.273
and the sun seems to shine brighter.

00:05:10.307 --> 00:05:13.476
And that is the complete
stress response cycle:

00:05:13.510 --> 00:05:16.780
it has a beginning,
when you perceive the threat;

00:05:16.813 --> 00:05:20.450
a middle, where you do something
with your body;

00:05:20.483 --> 00:05:24.487
and an end, where your body
receives the signal

00:05:24.521 --> 00:05:27.457
that it has escaped
from this potential threat,

00:05:27.457 --> 00:05:30.660
and your body is now
a safe place for you to be.